## Welcome to the KITTI Vision Benchmark Suite!
For this purpose, we equipped a standard station wagon with two high-resolution color and grayscale video cameras. Our datsets are captured by driving around the mid-size city of [Karlsruhe](http://maps.google.com/?ie=UTF8&z=15&ll=49.010627,8.405871&spn=0.018381,0.029826&t=k&om=1), in rural areas and on highways. Up to 15 cars and 30 pedestrians are visible per image.

